<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Features | StudentHub</title><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/js/theme.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/css/public.css?v=20260822"><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/js/public.js?v=20260822" defer></script></head><body class="public-page"><jsp:include page="partials/header.jsp"/><main><section class="page-hero"><div class="public-container"><p class="eyebrow">Built around campus life</p><h1>Everything you need for student life.</h1><p>One organized space for your academic community.</p></div></section><section class="content-section"><div class="public-container feature-grid"><article class="feature-card wide"><span class="card-icon">A</span><h2>Announcements</h2><p>Academic updates organized by semester, section and category.</p><div class="tag-list"><span>Assignment</span><span>Tutorial</span><span>Exam</span><span>Event</span><span>General News</span><span>Lecture Material</span></div></article><article class="feature-card narrow"><span class="card-icon">D</span><h2>Smart Deadlines</h2><p>Deadlines are part of announcements, keeping the work and its due date together.</p><div class="mini-deadline"><strong>Database Assignment</strong><p>Due tomorrow</p></div></article><article class="feature-card narrow"><span class="card-icon">N</span><h2>Notifications</h2><p>See timely alerts when important information is added to your academic scope.</p></article><article class="feature-card wide"><span class="card-icon">C</span><h2>Discussions / Chat</h2><p>Focused spaces for Section, Semester, All Students, CR – Same Semester and CR – All.</p><div class="mini-chat"><p><strong>Section A</strong><br>Has anyone started the database exercise?</p><p><strong>Class Representative</strong><br>I’ve shared the updated submission details.</p></div></article><article class="feature-card"><span class="card-icon">P</span><h2>Academic Profile</h2><p>Keep student academic information clear, current and connected to the right community.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><span class="card-icon">CR</span><h2>CR / Student Communication</h2><p>Class Representatives can share relevant academic information with the students who need it.</p></article></div></section><section class="cta-section"><div class="public-container"><div class="cta-band"><h2>Ready to simplify student life?</h2><a class="public-button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Get Started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section></main><jsp:include page="partials/footer.jsp"/></body></html>
